        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "上九爻，弗损益之①；无咎，贞吉，利有攸往，得臣无家②。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
